{
 "id": "story-isaks-binding-folk",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-isaks-binding-folk",
 "offset_seconds": -1.6200000000002213,
 "words_heard": 233,
 "words": 235,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Early in the morning Abraham got up before the light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saddled up the donkey, split the wood and tied it tight",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took the boy he loved, his only son, and walked for three long days",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Till he saw the mountain rising in the distance through the haze",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He laid the wood on Isaac and he took the fire and knife",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the boy looked up and asked him on the road toward the height",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here are the fire and the wood",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But where is the lamb for the burnt offering?",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God himself will provide the lamb for the burnt offering, my son",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the two of them walked on together",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the mountain of the LORD it will be provided",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He built an altar on the hill and laid the wood in place",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He bound the boy and raised the knife with sorrow on his face",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "An angel of the LORD called out, Abraham, from the sky",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lying there behind him in a thicket was a ram caught nearby",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here I am",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not lay a hand on the boy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I know that you fear God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Since you have not withheld your son, your only son",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God himself will provide the lamb for the burnt offering, my son",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the two of them walked on together",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the mountain of the LORD it will be provided",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD Will Provide",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD Will Provide",
   "heard": 4,
